 "summary": "A single 40 V Schottky barrier rectifier in the surface-mount SMB (DO-214AA) package, rated 2.0 A average forward current and 50 A surge. Its forward drop is at most 0.45 V at 2.0 A. It is intended for low-voltage, high-frequency inverters, freewheeling and polarity protection.",
